  "method": "Every GroundCore.Step call goes through CountingQueryView, a forwarding view over a real Bepu query view with no exclusions, under one read lease taken through the view. Each tick counts the calls the step makes. Default MoveTuning, foot radius fraction 0.5, dt 1/30, each tick fed the previous result's feet.",
